# Sanity Project (PakFactory)

Use the Knowledge Router for Sanity guidance. Available as a [Claude Code and Cursor plugin](https://github.com/sanity-io/agent-toolkit#option-3-install-plugin).

## Content writes (PakFactory — agents)

Per [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § **Sanity content — agent guardrails**:

- **Agents:** MCP and scripts are **read-only** for documents — use `query_documents`, `get_document`, `get_schema`, `search_docs`, and schema deploy only. **Never** create, patch, publish, delete, or run seed scripts against any dataset.
- **Humans:** Studio UI, `pnpm seed:*`, and approved migrations own all document writes.

## Commands

```bash
npx sanity@latest mcp configure
npx sanity schema deploy
npx sanity schema extract
npx sanity typegen generate
npx sanity docs search "query"
```

## Knowledge Router

If the Sanity MCP server (`https://mcp.sanity.io`) is available, use `list_sanity_rules` and `get_sanity_rules`. Otherwise use local Sanity skill references when installed.

| Topic | Trigger Keywords | Reference (plugin skills) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Schema** | `schema`, `model`, `document`, `field`, `defineType` | schema / project-structure |
| **GROQ** | `groq`, `query`, `defineQuery` | groq |
| **Next.js** | `app router`, `server component` | nextjs |
| **Page Builder** | `page builder`, `block` | page-builder |
| **Portable Text** | `portable text`, `PTE` | portable-text |
| **Images** | `image`, `urlFor`, `hotspot` | image |
| **Studio Structure** | `desk`, `singleton` | studio-structure |
| **SEO** | `metadata`, `json-ld`, `sitemap` | seo |
| **TypeGen** | `typegen`, `typescript` | typegen |

**PakFactory domain:** this is **not** a Shopify / Hydrogen storefront. Do not load storefront/commerce Sanity templates unless the user explicitly requests Shopify integration.

## Agent Behavior

- Prefer structured content, GROQ, and Studio configuration.
- Use `defineQuery` / `defineType` / `defineField` patterns from this repo.
- Detect the framework from the workspace (Next.js App Router).
